{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e46c155a2882378a8c67033bf607144bd8edd3b8b2bf099543e106e31db3ac0f",
      "text": "那档音乐节目收到了很多反响。\n那个，不仅是来自观众……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c886901f3cf05173de96c22c3b5b067e39f188d1338de003bf7145a94a5616",
      "text": "工作人员也表示这家事务所和偶像非常令人感激。\n这是当天的节目画面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b75f85a245d1682d93ff2e451fcc976c3f8a4637e2275d9ad039322c270cf83",
      "text": "电视机前的各位，\n听我们的歌听得还开心吗—！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3c56537fa53414cb99811277a69ade4712273eb204931ee6e2e9fa6b637e68",
      "text": "…我们今后也不会吝啬任何努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65289a6d4e7c045323605f14024961a45b7a95ab8e3fa4e796b2f7e6e9bb9fb1",
      "text": "所以，还请多多支持我们！\n以上就是F-LAGS！下次再见喽—！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ac4975f87d902df4ac05f14c9b2ee83de2e80e2e0f7a2c1c9cc224700a12e9",
      "text": "就算拿录像给我看，我这个只是出钱当赞助商的老太婆\n也看不出跟其他偶像有什么区别。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1aaa45d87285fa238cb06ad2551ebe3b08aa93aff237eb3c44a71cb69c277e",
      "text": "不过，单看这观众人数和咨询量，\n看来是我的眼光出了差错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2e9e2f97a26b9084453c49a488c66991c64d2359480e2ccfecfb9dd5accbf5",
      "text": "行吧，对这档音乐节目的投资就按继续推进处理。\n还有，关于315 Pro出演JIF的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e811039032029cdd74dd4fe074da803c9ab62889bdbf26e312ff8473b35aef9b",
      "text": "我觉得挺好的。\n就直接按内定去推进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
